How do you call a Terraform module from another module or root module?  

To call a Terraform module from either a root or another child module, we use the module block in our configuration file 

module "my_service" {
  source = "./modules/service_name" # Required: Path or URL to the module
  
  # Input variables defined in the child module
  variable_name = "value"
}

Terraform can load modules from several types of locations 

Local Paths 
Terraform Registry
GitHub 
Private Registries  

Example: 
module "module_local_name" {
  source = "path_or_repository_url"

  # Input variables required by the module
  variable_name = "value"
}
